The ported files are under packages/engine/src/physics. Each names, in its
header, the IHMC source file and its module (ihmc-common-walking-control-modules,
ihmc-robotics-toolkit or ihmc-yovariables), the release (develop, tag
201903_Stable or, for Euclid, 0.11.0) and the lines it ports; each was changed from Java to
TypeScript. They are:

- physicalAngularMomentumIntegrator.ts (AngularMomentumIntegrator)
- physicalFootstepAdjustor.ts (FootstepAdjustor)
- physicalGlitchFilter.ts (GlitchFilteredYoBoolean)
- physicalIcpController*.ts (ICPController, ICPControllerQPSolver,
  ICPControllerQPInputCalculator, ICPControllerQPConstraintCalculator,
  ICPControllerHelper, ConstraintToConvexRegion)
- physicalIcpPlanner*.ts (ContinuousCMPBasedICPPlanner, AbstractICPPlanner,
  ReferenceCentroidalMomentumPivotLocationsCalculator,
  ICPPlannerSegmentedTrajectoryGenerator, ICPPlannerTrajectoryGenerator,
  CapturePointTools, and the walking states and balance manager they name)
- preparePhysicalDisturbanceSpan.ts (CapturePointTools, CoMIntegrationTools)
- physicalOneStepCaptureRegion.ts (OneStepCaptureRegionCalculator,
  CaptureRegionMathTools)
- physicalPlanarPolygon.ts (Euclid EuclidGeometryPolygonTools and
  ConvexPolygon2D; ConvexPolygonScaler; PolygonWiggler)
- physicalPushRecovery.ts (PushRecoveryControlModule)

Parameter values from IHMC's Zulu robot configuration (zulu/...) are cited
where they are used.
